      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can back this.  I feel that all it takes is being off a few degrees between showing your appreciation for a DJ's work as being positive, and negative.\n\nWould appreciate Coal being shifted elsewhere on the wheel.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
