  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-06-12T02:15:24.920Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In clubs, it's customary to throw snowflake emojis at the DJ after a good set. However, with the coal and snowflake emojis right next to each other, it's way too easy to accidentally throw coal at the DJ instead if your joystick is slightly mis-aimed.\n\nTo counter that, I propose swapping the positions of the coal and confetti emojis, so that accidentally mis-clicking when trying to throw snowflakes will throw confetti instead, which is much better than coal.",
